{"id":"wb-7-18","name":"伏羲台遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"伏羲台遗址","text":"伏羲台遗址，位于中国河北省石家庄市古城村，为石家庄市新乐市的一个全国重点文物保护单位，总占地面积151875平方米，类型为古遗址，公布时间为2013年5月。\n伏羲台由上下三层台罗叠而成，台高9.3米，第三层台呈不等边八角形，名八卦台。其主体建筑自南向北排列在一条中轴线上，有山门、六佐殿、龙师殿、寝宫，中轴线两侧有华胥庙、钟鼓二亭，主体建筑龙师殿、寝宫、六佐殿始建于商周。台上有历代石碑刻、槐抱椿、槐抱槐、阴阳柏等景观。\n伏羲台遗址的历史年代为战国、汉。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BC%8F%E7%BE%B2%E5%8F%B0%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":86554951,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86554951","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7e68fded98b8805c0eb55192.jpg","title":"Fuxi_temple.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fuxi_temple.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/Fuxi_temple.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Fanghong","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"Fu xi temple in Xinle,Hebei,China.","width":320,"height":212}}